This is the licence thegovlab.org and innovate-us.org state for their content.

Attribution: The GovLab and InnovateUS at the Burnes Center for Social Change,
Northeastern University, with a link to https://github.com/GovLab/open-corpus.

The entries for Reboot Democracy (references/blog-posts.md and
references/news-digests.md) list titles and teasers from rebootdemocracy.ai,
which states no licence; this file grants none for them.

The pages, documents and recordings the entries link to keep their own
licences.
